WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.434
-We have exactly two shows left

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:04.367
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:06.267
for that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:09.667
It's time for "12 Days
of Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.000
-♪ 12 Days
of Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.968
♪ Two days l-e-e-eft ♪

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:20.300
-That's right. Every show
between now and Christmas,

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.667
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:25.601
a swag-a-docious
Christmas sweater

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:28.400
from the
Countdown to Christmas Cabinet.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.133
Since there are two shows left,
let's open door number 2.

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:35.133
-2.
-Yeah. Where we going?

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:36.534
-Down this way.
-Ooh!

00:00:36.534 --> 00:00:38.067
It's over by -- close to me.
All right.

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:39.834
Whenever you're ready.
Yeah, go for it, bud.

00:00:39.834 --> 00:00:41.000
Oh, wow.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.000
♪♪

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:45.901 --> 00:00:47.834
Wow.

00:00:47.834 --> 00:00:49.601
Thank you very much.
-Yeah.

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:52.534
-Can we --
-That's crazy.

00:00:52.534 --> 00:00:54.400
-Can we --
[ Laughs ]

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.000
Can we dim the lights?

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.200
Can we dim the lights
for this guy?

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.601
Look at this.

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:04.534
Yeah -- ooh, that's --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:07.901
Now let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.501
Everyone,
look at your seat number.

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:12.133
If I call your number,
come on down!

00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:14.434
Quest, can I get
a drumroll, please?

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:18.434
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:21.000
112!

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:22.434
Where you at, 112?

00:01:22.434 --> 00:01:24.434
♪♪

00:01:24.434 --> 00:01:25.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:27.133
There you go.

00:01:27.133 --> 00:01:31.400
♪♪

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.334
Come on over!
Hey!

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:36.400
Hi!

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.934
Nice to see you.
It's a pleasure.

00:01:39.934 --> 00:01:41.801
What is your name,
and where are you from?

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.901
-My name is Afsani.
I'm from Iran.

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:45.133
-Hey!
Welcome!

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:46.634
Thank you for being here!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.634 --> 00:01:48.968
Welcome, welcome,
welcome to our show.

00:01:48.968 --> 00:01:50.667
-Thank you.
-And New York.

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:52.534
It's a little chilly outside.
-It is.

00:01:52.534 --> 00:01:54.033
-You need a little bit
more than that.

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:55.968
-Of course.
-Yes, I mean, it looks gorgeous,

00:01:55.968 --> 00:01:58.133
but this -- do you have
anything like this at home?

00:01:58.133 --> 00:01:59.934
-No.
-No?

00:01:59.934 --> 00:02:01.367
Would you like
to try this on for us?

00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:03.267
-Of course.
-Yeah, this'll be fun.

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:04.901
Here, I'll help you out.
Thank you.

00:02:04.901 --> 00:02:05.968
Go through there.

00:02:05.968 --> 00:02:08.067
There's no real right way
to put it on.

00:02:08.067 --> 00:02:11.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:11.934 --> 00:02:13.467
There you go. Oh.
-I'm stuck.

00:02:13.467 --> 00:02:14.901
-Are you stuck?
-No.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:16.868
-No, you're in.
Wow, look at this.

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:19.000
Are you kidding me?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.567
You look gorgeous!
Look at this.

00:02:20.567 --> 00:02:22.267
Wow!
-Thank you!

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:23.767
-You look fantastic!
What a model.

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:25.100
Thank you very much.
-Thank you.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.601
-Congratulations.
Thank you for being here.

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:28.634
Oh, please, I appreciate it.
Give a round of applause.

00:02:28.634 --> 00:02:29.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:29.667 --> 00:02:30.968
That was fantastic.

